                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "385203c9-ccda-39fc-9add-72561bc74b77",
                        "entry_id": "15461881-d812-34ec-95ab-4501fce29044",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A binge or period of overindulgence; a spree."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b6825234-96ca-4616-9164-89e3d3a90471",
                                "sense_id": "385203c9-ccda-39fc-9add-72561bc74b77",
                                "text": "Consider, the pessimists argue, the vast number of plays which it is only possible to sit through with the assistance of what Ella Wheeler Wilcox would call a mild jag."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d3fe93fc-68aa-45f4-956b-fcd8191250e3",
                                "sense_id": "385203c9-ccda-39fc-9add-72561bc74b77",
                                "text": "‘People who spend their money for second-hand sex jags are as nervous as dowagers who can't find the rest-room.’"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a1fc7018-720c-3d1e-902b-e91c35d20440",
                        "entry_id": "15461881-d812-34ec-95ab-4501fce29044",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A fit, spell, outburst."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ba306af7-3697-4aa9-aad0-04fe885c3e3d",
                                "sense_id": "a1fc7018-720c-3d1e-902b-e91c35d20440",
                                "text": "Of course she did not lose her sense of humor (not necessarily to be confused with her laughing fits, which are crying jags turned inside out according to the shrinks)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "55d7b571-d7d0-4b00-afb2-237cffc06555",
                                "sense_id": "a1fc7018-720c-3d1e-902b-e91c35d20440",
                                "text": "Miles had a cold, he always had a cold, it went unnoticed, went without saying, he had coughing jags and slightly woozy eyes, completely unremarked by people who knew him […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9a4f400a-6c52-314a-b4a8-0cdf0c1638ca",
                        "entry_id": "15461881-d812-34ec-95ab-4501fce29044",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A one-horse cart load, or, in modern times, a truck load, of hay or wood."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
